sed","firstPartyEvents","url","/dailyinfo/media/5d8ab2385f367af4.jpg","srcSet","/dailyinfo/media/57404edcae2edb4d.jpg 720w, /dailyinfo/media/faca5e47cc647722.jpg 1200w, /dailyinfo/media/5d8ab2385f367af4.jpg 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_111":139,"_40":140,"_114":141,"_116":134,"_118":142,"_120":143,"_122":137,"_124":138,"_126":129,"_128":129},{"_111":131,"_40":132,"_114":133,"_116":134,"_118":135,"_120":136,"_122":137,"_124":138,"_126":129,"_128":129},{"_111":112,"_40":113,"_114":115,"_116":117,"_118":119,"_120":121,"_122":123,"_124":125,"_126":127,"_128":129,"_130":51},"itemId","xjtk4qapk0fz040tt5c9vm102","WordPress CVE-2026-119977 已在野利用，安装修复时仍可能再次被攻破","summary","WordPress CVE-2026-119977 已被确认在野利用，但安装 7.1.4 修复版本时，部分站点仍会因旧版更新器使用可预测的 wp-content/upgrade 目录名而再次暴露安装器。","sourceName","The Hacker News","sourceUrl","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/installing-fix-for-exploited-wordpress.html","publishedAt","2026-11-06T16:08:38.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"followUp","wlow3wts75k3iwu5wwonpyqpi","LXD 恶意镜像可经 templates 符号链接读写宿主机任意文件","LXD 可被构造的恶意容器镜像利用，通过未拦截的顶层 templates 符号链接读取或创建及写入宿主机任意目录中的文件，进而可能执行任意命令。PoC 将 templates 映射至宿主机 /etc/cron.d，并创建以 root 身份运行 id 的定时任务，展示了读取、写入及命令执行路径。","GitHub 安全公告","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-jpf8-86f3-wp38","2026-11-06T18:53:57.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f426f4f60d806c23.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp 96w","xol3ijobpc59mci7fq0ae59nk","OSAC operator console-proxy 存在 kubeconfig 凭据插件执行与 SSRF 漏洞","OSAC operator 的 console-proxy 在解析 Kubernetes Secret 中的 kubeconfig 时未清理 exec 插件配置，可导致服务账户权限范围内远程代码执行，并通过攻击者控制的 clusters[].server 实施 SSRF。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-5w5g-j6hw-6p8f","2026-11-06T18:12:40.000Z",{"_147":184,"_114":-5,"_149":185},{"_147":157,"_114":-5,"_149":158},{"_147":148,"_114":-5,"_149":150},"label","AI 安全","items",[151],{"_111":152,"_40":153,"_114":154,"_116":117,"_118":155,"_120":156,"_122":123,"_124":125,"_126":127,"_128":129},"lumlbzum3afm0fmdtcxu7t21q","Claude Code 将批准命令中的密码与密钥明文保存在项目文件，GitHub 发现 1,122 份公开副本","Claude Code 在用户选择“Yes, and don't ask again”后，会将批准的命令原样写入 .claude/settings.local.json，若命令含密码或令牌也会以明文保存。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/claude-codes-dont-ask-again-file.html","2026-11-07T06:44:17.000Z","攻击与威胁",[159,160,161],{"_111":176,"_40":177,"_114":178,"_116":179,"_118":180,"_120":181,"_122":182,"_124":183,"_126":127,"_128":129},{"_111":168,"_40":169,"_114":170,"_116":171,"_118":172,"_120":173,"_122":174,"_124":175,"_126":127,"_128":129},{"_111":162,"_40":163,"_114":164,"_116":165,"_118":166,"_120":167,"_122":-5,"_126":127,"_128":129},"cd10ku2jyo2zjhf6tnrhavx0z","Storm-3358 扩大利用 ARTEX 攻击东南亚及全球金融机构","Storm-3358 于 2026 年 10 月起使用 agentic AI 渗透测试框架 ARTEX 攻击东南亚金融机构及少量全球大型金融组织。该入侵团伙结合传统自动化工具扫描公网系统，利用匿名文件上传、SSRF 等缺陷，安装 WISP、vshell 和 AdaptixC2 RAT，并通过 Web shell、泄露凭据、云身份及暴力破解开展持久化、横向移动、提权与数据外传。","Microsoft Security Blog","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/11/06/artex-abuse-expands-as-cybercriminals-target-financial-sector/","2026-11-07T02:44:34.000Z","ucovakubvkebsauqv049n97vi","Hunt.io 披露 ARTEX 攻击韩国 7 家金融机构数据泄露","Hunt.io 追踪了 ARTEX 开源自主渗透测试框架及其 AI 攻击基础设施，关联 2026 年 9 月底至 10 月初韩国 7 家金融机构通过互联网暴露系统发起的泄露事件，影响约 66,000 至 67,000 人和约 2,200 家公司，个人、就业、收入与贷款数据外泄。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/202607/ai/inside-artex-ai-hacking-tools-exposed-servers-and-south-korean-bank-breaches.html","2026-11-07T19:56:18.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","qt4a7nln856uan1eob526jcmp","QNAP称Plex2Shell漏洞链已被用于入侵NAS设备","Plex2Shell漏洞链已被用于攻击暴露在公网的QNAP NAS，QNAP称已收到多起客户设备疑似失陷报告。该漏洞链包含CVE-2026-96652、CVE-2026-96654、CVE-2026-96655和CVE-2026-96656，CISA于2026年10月20日将其列入KEV目录。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/qnap-says-hackers-breaching-nas-devices-in-plex2shell-attacks/","2026-11-06T17:04:23.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","漏洞与在野利用",[186,187,188,189],{"_111":82,"_40":62,"_114":207,"_116":179,"_118":208,"_120":209,"_122":182,"_124":183,"_126":127,"_128":129},{"_111":200,"_40":201,"_114":202,"_116":203,"_118":204,"_120":205,"_122":-5,"_126":129,"_128":129,"_206":33,"_130":57},{"_111":195,"_40":196,"_114":197,"_116":134,"_118":198,"_120":199,"_122":137,"_124":138,"_126":129,"_128":129},{"_111":190,"_40":191,"_114":192,"_116":134,"_118":193,"_120":194,"_122":137,"_124":138,"_126":129,"_128":129},"mrpepymif8ptdu6v6wcid81kx","LXD 镜像 URL 导入功能存在 SSRF，可探测内部网络","LXD 的 POST /1.0/images 镜像 URL 导入功能存在 SSRF，具备 can_create_images 权限的用户可让守护进程请求回环地址、RFC1918 私网及 169.254.169.254 等云元数据端点。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-3gq2-x4qg-p4g6","2026-11-06T18:29:18.000Z","hk714ipariljekiun88mpsvd2","LXD 快照绕过受限项目限制导致 Incus 服务器任意命令执行","LXD 的实例快照会忽略 `restricted.containers.lowlevel=block` 设置，攻击者可借助 `raw.lxc`、`raw.qemu` 等低层钩子，在 Incus 服务器上以 root 权限执行任意命令。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-47w9-6r3f-938g","2026-11-06T19:51:26.000Z","j353lmgbdt1vzxfl5am6xcscg","OpenSSH/musl密码认证绕过漏洞CVE-2026-123158已复现，受影响版本为7.3p1至10.6p2","绿盟科技CERT披露并成功复现OpenSSH/musl密码认证绕过漏洞CVE-2026-123158，CVSS评分为8.1。","绿盟科技CERT","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0MjE3ODkxNg==&mid=2247493747&idx=1&sn=db0e3b3dd13eaf2ba1ae1f7f34690a78","2026-11-06T10:03:00.000Z","otherSources","SonicWall SSL-VPN 的 SAML 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-19868 已被用于攻击，攻击者持有另一种认证方式的有效凭据后，可绕过 SAML 认证控制，包括 SAML 强制启用的 MFA。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/sonicwall-warns-of-new-ssl-vpn-mfa-bypass-flaw-exploited-in-attacks/","2026-11-07T00:00:55.000Z",{"_111":200,"_40":201,"_114":202,"_116":203,"_118":204,"_120":205,"_122":-5,"_126":129,"_128":129,"_206":33,"_130":57},{"_111":176,"_40":177,"_114":178,"_116":179,"_118":180,"_120":181,"_122":182,"_124":183,"_126":127,"_128":129},{"_111":168,"_40":169,"_114":170,"_116":171,"_118":172,"_120":173,"_122":174,"_124":175,"_126":127,"_128":129},"leadParagraph",{"_215":216,"_217":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
